  m_Name: Choice_BarnWorker_BarnTalk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.ChoiceDialogueNode
  text: A worker who took from that barn would be the first man suspected and the first man hanged. You'd have to be a fool, and the fools here don't last long enough to steal.
